          "key": "preview-save-publish",
          "title": "Test, save, and publish",
          "instruction": "Select **Preview**, open a request, change **Status** and **Coordinator notes**, then select **Save**. Return to Studio, select **Save**, and then **Publish**.",
          "hint": "Preview catches formula and form behavior problems before users see the app.",
          "explanation": "Publishing makes the saved version available to users; testing first reduces broken formulas reaching users.",
          "targetId": "studio-preview",
