          "successFeedback": "The canvas app is connected, formula-driven, tested, and published.",
          "failureFeedback": "Complete the data connection, formulas, Preview test, Save, and Publish."
        }
      ],
      "solution": "1. Select **Apps**, then open **Service Requests Mobile**.\n2. Select **Data**. Choose **Microsoft Dataverse**, table **Service Requests**, then **Connect**.\n3. Select **Tree view**. Set **galRequests.Items** to `SortByColumns(Filter('Service Requests', IsBlank(txtSearch.Text) || StartsWith(Title, txtSearch.Text) || StartsWith(Status, txtSearch.Text)), \"DueDate\", Ascending)`.\n4. Set **lblCount.Text** to `CountRows(galRequests.AllItems) & \" requests\"`.\n5. Set **frmRequest.DataSource** to `'Service Requests'`, **frmRequest.Item** to `galRequests.Selected`, and **btnSave.OnSelect** to `SubmitForm(frmRequest); Notify(\"Request saved\", NotificationType.Success)`.\n6. Select **Preview**, open a row, update **Status** and **Coordinator notes**, and select **Save**.\n7. Select **Save**, then **Publish**."
